  Vector Error Correction Model
=============================================================

  nabla Y_t = alpha (beta'Y_{t-1} - E[W]) + Gamma_1 nabla Y_{t-1} + ... + Theta(L) A_t
  Theta(L) = I - Theta1 L - ... - Theta_q L^q,   Pi = alpha beta'

